# Inputs of requirements/backend.txt: the environment .gnomon/ci.sh tests the
# backend in (backend/.venv in CI). Re-lock after editing this file or any
# pyproject.toml it names:  python3 scripts/py_lock.py relock
#
# The local packages are resolved from their pyproject.toml and left out of the
# lock (they install editable, from this checkout, with --no-deps). pip, hatchling
# and editables are locked too: pip because the gate audits it, the other two
# because the editable installs build with --no-build-isolation, from the lock,
# instead of fetching an unhashed build backend.
pip
hatchling
editables
-e ./packages/causal-core
-e ./packages/causal-decision
-e ./backend[dev]

